[I] Osinfo database of OS information

[T] Osinfo database of information about operating systems for virtualization
[T] provisioning tools.

[U] https://gitlab.com/libosinfo/osinfo-db

[A] libosinfo
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 20260812

[D] b9d595e0f3cbb8e149cd754480564d61f458247ad753a46a0830192d osinfo-db-v20260812.tar.gz https://gitlab.com/libosinfo/osinfo-db/-/archive/v20260812/

mkdir -p $root$datadir/osinfo
[ -z "$root" ] && makeinstopt='DESTDIR="/" OSINFO_DB_TARGET="--dir=$datadir/osinfo" install' ||
	makeinstopt='DESTDIR="$root" OSINFO_DB_TARGET="--dir=$datadir/osinfo" install'
